    <string name="help_shortcuts">Help &amp; shortcuts</string>
    <string name="help_text">TOUCH\n• Two fingers: zoom and pan the canvas\n• Tap with two fingers: undo\n• Tap with three fingers: redo\n• Select tool: drag a rectangle, then drag inside it to move\n• Move tool: moves the whole layer (or the selection)\n\nKEYBOARD\n• P pencil, B brush, E eraser, G bucket\n• L line, R rectangle, O ellipse\n• S select, M move, H hand, I color picker\n• Ctrl+Z undo, Ctrl+Y redo, Ctrl+C/X/V copy, cut, paste\n• + / − zoom, 0 fit, [ ] brush size, Space play\n\nANIMATION\n• Tap + in the timeline to add a frame\n• Long-press a frame for its menu\n• Onion skin shows the previous (red) and next (blue) frames</string>
